    "00d01f38093349f3cb5563ea9320dcbfd2a1547b66e05e830fdfb6e2a3c43a09": "Welcome to Note",
    "a535bd50db7827d65c1461b7b3bd94c0d339cd4ea5439c8bff9b2465ce6dac25": "This is your first note — feel free to edit or delete it.",
    "af27b67a137d71592eeb261c15908ba4adf1040836bfe6bdca30661b825592e7": "Notes are the primary place to capture and develop your thinking. Each note is made of chunks you can reorganise with drag-and-drop.",
    "b5cc13ff3adfa4b79ef49a8e5b118b1c09ce237dbdd30957eca1f6c5c7718e42": "Use the File menu to export your note as an Akasha capsule file (.akasha), or to import notes shared by others.",
    "da2073aba66f03a9ec99a8513b22fdf790e4a9ebf73ef83ed521b434ee9ba85e": "Tip: open the Guide (? button) for a full list of keyboard shortcuts."
  },
